# RealEarth environment variables (example / template).
#
# Copy to `.env` and edit, or export individual vars. These are read by the
# install/expand/build scripts (Makefile, scripts/*.sh) and the offline Python
# pipeline (tools/). They are NOT read by the in-game C# mod, which is configured
# via Config/realearth.json.
#
# Required for install / expand / package (game path):
#   SEVENDTD_GAME_DIR  - Steam install root of 7 Days to Die (client or dedicated).
#                        Make knob GAME_DIR overrides it; an explicit
#                        `make install GAME_DIR=...` re-exports SEVENDTD_GAME_DIR.
#   DOTNET_ROOT        - directory of a .NET SDK (see global.json for the pin).
#                        Auto-detected from common local SDK caches if unset.
#
# Optional:
#   STEAM_DIR          - extra Steam library root for Proton prefixes
#                        (tools/realearth/proton_paths.py). Unset = default layout.
#   SEVENDTD_SERVER_DIR - Steam root of the dedicated server. The install
#                        scripts also install into it when it already has a
#                        Mods/ directory. Unset = default client-tree path.
#   RE_TERRARIUM_CACHE - disk cache for fetched AWS terrarium elevation tiles
#                        (tools/realearth/elevation.py). Unset = no caching.
#   RE_FORCE_RESTORE   - set to 1 to let backup_artifacts.sh overwrite existing
#                        artifacts during restore.
#   RE_BACKUP_DIR      - where backup_artifacts.sh writes archives.
#                        Unset = <repo>/backups (move them off-host).
#   RE_SAVE_TRASH_DAYS - days backup_artifacts.sh keeps replaced saves before
#                        deleting them. Unset = 7.
#   RE_BACKUP_MAX_AGE_DAYS - days before `backup_artifacts.sh status` calls the
#                        newest archive stale. Unset = 7.
#   RE_ROOT            - tree backup_artifacts.sh operates on. Unset = the
#                        repository root. Only the artifacts-drill sandbox
#                        overrides it; never point it at another tree.
#   MAP_MODE           - Streamed (default) | Baked, passed to make install*.
#
# Dedicated server + load-test knobs (scripts/start_dedicated_*.sh,
# scripts/run_dedicated_height_test.sh). All have working defaults; set them to
# run a scenario other than the default one.
#   RE_DEDICATED_USERDATA - dedicated UserData folder (worlds, saves, live
#                           serverconfig, pid/log). Unset = ~/.cache/realearth-dedicated.
#   RE_WORLD_NAME         - generated world to load. Unset = RealEarth_H500
#                           (dedicated) or RWG (prefab script).
#   RE_SERVER_MAX_PLAYERS - ServerMaxPlayerCount. Unset = 1024 (height test) / 64 (prefab).
#   RE_SERVER_SOAK        - seconds the height test soaks after the world is up. Unset = 35.
#   RE_SERVER_WAIT        - seconds to wait for the server to come up. Unset = 180.
#   RE_SCENARIO_PACK      - everest | trench; selects the tile pack the dedicated
#                           server installs. Unset = the staged H500 pack.
#   RE_WORLD_GEN_SIZE     - RWG size for the prefab script. Unset = 4096.
#   RE_WORLD_GEN_SEED     - RWG seed for the prefab script. Unset = botpoi4k.
#   RE_GAME_NAME          - dedicated instance name for the prefab script.
#   RE_LOADTEST_ROOT      - sibling 7dtd-loadgen checkout. Unset = ../7dtd-loadgen.
#   RE_VIEWER_SMOKE_PORT  - port the headless viewer smoke binds. Unset = 8765.
#   RE_VIEWER_SMOKE_HARNESS - harness page the headless viewer smoke loads.
#                        Unset = <repo>/viewer/smoke.html (tracked).
#   RE_VIEWER_SMOKE_URL   - URL that page is served under. Unset = /smoke.html.
#   RE_SCRATCH         - scratch dir for run logs and captures. Unset =
#                        <repo>/.scratch (height test) or the loadgen default.
#
# JS toolchain pins (scripts/*.sh source scripts/toolchain-versions.env; each may
# be overridden, e.g. TSC_VERSION=5.9.3 bash scripts/lint-viewer.sh):
#   ESBUILD_VERSION, TSC_VERSION, OXLINT_VERSION, OXLINT_TSGOLINT_VERSION,
#   OXLINT_PLUGINS_VERSION, OXLINT_STANDARDS_VERSION, ANTI_SLOP_SHA,
#   THREE_TYPES_VERSION, THREE_VERSION, VNU_VERSION
#
# No secrets are used by RealEarth: the tile CDN URL and AWS terrarium endpoint are
# configuration/data sources, not credentials. Never put a real secret in these
# variables. `.env` itself is git-ignored; only this template is tracked.

SEVENDTD_GAME_DIR="${SEVENDTD_GAME_DIR:-$HOME/.local/share/Steam/steamapps/common/7 Days To Die}"
# DOTNET_ROOT=
# STEAM_DIR=
# SEVENDTD_SERVER_DIR=
# RE_TERRARIUM_CACHE=
# RE_FORCE_RESTORE=
# RE_BACKUP_DIR=
# RE_SAVE_TRASH_DAYS=7
